# Senda de Campeones, floor 2 (C9, contract 56), 28 x 22, a cave. The ladder from floor 1 arrives in the SE hall (down ladder (24,19), spawn from_1); the boulder (16,17) is pushed west along row 17 (the 1-wide
# connector) into the pit (9,17) (7 pushes); that opens the GATE OF ROCKS (5,8) in the corridor north of the west chamber (the step trigger (5,9)); the top hall holds the ladder up (23,3), an elite and an item. A psychic trainer waits in the
# west chamber, a karateka in the arrival hall.
@map senda_2
@size 28 22
@interior no
@cave yes
@area senda_campeones
@bg 0
@fill rockg
@spawn from_1 23 19 W
@spawn from_3 22 3 S
@flag senda_pit2 907                  # the pit of floor 2 (a boulder filled it)
@flag senda2_open 910                  # the gate of floor 2 opened (set by the step trigger once the pit is filled)
@flag beaten_psiquico_s2a 918
@flag beaten_elite_s2b 919
@flag beaten_karateka_s2c 920
@encounters grass rate=14
  tuskid 40 44 5
  tuskmash 43 46 15
  cragodile 40 44 10
  echowing 42 46 20
  rockroll 42 46 5
  dashmark 43 46 10
  bouldrum 44 47 25
  kickaroo 42 45 5
  jabadillo 42 45 5
@end
# Open ground (contract 63, wild zone): a step onto plain ground (not tall grass, water, a door, a ledge, an arrow floor) rolls this table when rand8 < 8 (8/256 per step).
@open_rate 8
# Roaming wild creatures (contract 55, rollout in 63): 3 creatures of this table wander the whole walkable floor (grass included); touching one starts that wild battle.
@roam 3 table=grass area=,. period=1800
@legend
  .  tile=rockg
  ,  tile=rockf
  W  tile=none object=swall
  r  tile=none object=srubble
  _  tile=none
  f  tile=rockg object=torch
  a  tile=rockg object=stalag_a
  b  tile=rockg boulder=yes
  h  tile=rockg hole=senda_pit2
  G  tile=rockg npc=rock_gate id=gate2 face=S solid=yes gate=yes hide_flag=senda2_open text=sd.gate
  t  tile=rockf interact=step script=gate2_check
  L  tile=rockf door=rope_ladder
  n  tile=rockf
  i  item=prime_salve
  j  item=ultra_cristal
  k  item=ward_spray
  l  item=vit_spc
  A  tile=rockg npc=psiquico_s id=psiquico_s2a face=SW trainer=psiquico_s2a range=3 text=tr.psiquico_s2a.pre after=tr.psiquico_s2a.after beaten_flag=beaten_psiquico_s2a
  B  tile=rockg npc=karateka_s id=karateka_s2c face=SW trainer=karateka_s2c range=3 text=tr.karateka_s2c.pre after=tr.karateka_s2c.after beaten_flag=beaten_karateka_s2c
  C  tile=rockg npc=elite_s id=elite_s2b face=SW trainer=elite_s2b range=3 text=tr.elite_s2b.pre after=tr.elite_s2b.after beaten_flag=beaten_elite_s2b
  U  tile=rockf door=rope_ladder
  c  tile=rockf item=growth_seed
  H  tile=rockg hidden=life_blaze   # hidden (contract 80, hidden items)
@grid
  ____________________________
  __WWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWW__
  __Wf...........l.........fr_
  __W....................U..r_
  __W........Ca.............r_
  __W.......................r_
  __W.....................j.r_
  ___rW.rrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrr__
  ____WGr_____________________
  ____Wtr_____________________
  __WWW,WWW___________________
  __Wf.,..cr__________________
  __WH.....r__________________
  __W......r___WWWWWWWWWWWWW__
  __W....A.r___Wf..a.......fr_
  __W......r___W......B.....r_
  __W......WWWWW............r_
  __W......h......b.........r_
  __W......rrrrW.........,..r_
  __W.i....r___W........,,L.r_
  __W.....ar___W......a.....r_
  ___rrrrrr_____rrrrrrrrrrrr__
@warp L -> senda_1 spawn=from_2
@warp U -> senda_3 spawn=from_2
# The gate of floor 2 (the Senda's switch, Senda de Campeones boulder switches): a boulder pushed onto the pit fills it (flag senda_pit2, engine); the step trigger in front of the gate opens it the moment the hero
# stands there (a wall of rocks that crumbles); the gate's own hide flag keeps it open for good.
@script gate2_check step if senda_pit2
    jf senda2_open done
    sfx door
    npc_hide gate2
    setf senda2_open
  done:
    end
@end
